                <pb facs="0340" n="260" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg260"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Hunter.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-09-17"><hi rendition="#italic">September 17,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In name of Mrs. McKinley, President Roosevelt, and American Government and
                    people, please express through proper channel to President Estrada sincere
                    estimation of his messages of personal sympathy and of the fraternal sentiment
                    of Guatemala in this hour of affliction.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
